Authored assets for The Brute go here: its Blueprint, its animation Blueprint,
retargeted animation sequences, and material instances.

NOT in game/Content/ParagonRampage/. That folder holds the third-party pack the
Brute's art comes from and is excluded from git, so anything saved inside it is
dropped by `git add` with no error and no warning.

game/docs/content-layout.md is the full convention. This file exists because git
does not track empty folders.
